*>================================================================
*> PROGRAM:  lob_twap_engine.cbl
*> PURPOSE:  Time-Weighted Order Slicing & Algorithmic Dispatch
*> ================================================================
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. LOB-TWAP-ENGINE.

 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
 SPECIAL-NAMES.
     DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.

 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY "TWAP-CONFIG.cpy".
 01  LS-DISPATCH-QTY        PIC 9(08) COMP-5.

 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING TWAP-EXECUTION-STATE, LS-DISPATCH-QTY.
 0000-MAIN.
     IF TWAP-REMAINING-QTY > 0
         IF TWAP-REMAINING-QTY >= TWAP-SLICE-QUANTITY
             MOVE TWAP-SLICE-QUANTITY TO LS-DISPATCH-QTY
         ELSE
             MOVE TWAP-REMAINING-QTY TO LS-DISPATCH-QTY
         END-IF
         SUBTRACT LS-DISPATCH-QTY FROM TWAP-REMAINING-QTY
         ADD 1 TO TWAP-SLICES-DISPATCHED
         IF TWAP-REMAINING-QTY = 0
             MOVE 'N' TO TWAP-ACTIVE-FLAG
         END-IF
     ELSE
         MOVE 0 TO LS-DISPATCH-QTY
         MOVE 'N' TO TWAP-ACTIVE-FLAG
     END-IF
     GOBACK.
